        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hanover Hound, Toy Trawler Spaniel, Bavarian Mountain Hound, Bavarian Hound, King Charles Spaniel\n- Concepts: dog breeds, extinct breeds, crossbreeding, alternate names\n\nFacts:\n- The Hanover Hound is a breed of dog that is sometimes referred to as the Hanoverian Hound.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel is an extinct breed of Spaniel.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel physically resembled the 16th-century King Charles Spaniel.\n- The Bavarian Mountain Hound is a cross between the Bavarian Hound and the Hanover Hound.",
